    "title": "High School Basketball Scores and Weather Report",
    "text": "• Perry defeated Phoenix Sunnyslope with a score of 58-50 in a girls' prep basketball game.\n• Phoenix Horizon defeated Mesa Skyline with a score of 67-35 in a girls' prep basketball game.\n• Basketball scores were provided by Scorestream.com.\n• The weather forecast for the day includes some clouds, a low of 56F, and winds from the north at 5 to 10 mph.\n• The weather forecast for the day includes mostly cloudy skies early, becoming partly cloudy later, a high of 76F, and winds from the north at 10 to 15 mph.\n• An Arizona lawmaker wants to restrict what can be bought with food stamps.\n• The lawmaker's proposal is to have purchases made with Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program benefits mirror the Women, Infants, and Children program.\n• The Senate Minority Leader questions the government's role in making choices for benefit recipients.",
